!Name: rake-c12d-c12d
!C Period 864 Cordership-based Cordership rake.
!C This diagonal c/12 puffer produces Corderships using a reaction
!C almost identical to that used in Paul Tooke's old Cordership gun.
!C Since the Corderships travel the same speed as the rake, but at
!C right angles to it, they emerge as a horizontal line.
!C David I. Bell, 27 December 2008
!Source: jslife-oversize-20100113
